<https://data.impix.co.kr/codelist/ProjectStatusCode> a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "프로젝트상태코드"@ko ; skos:notation "ProjectStatusCode" ; skos:definition "프로젝트 상태(등록, 진행, 종료 등)"@ko .
<https://data.impix.co.kr/codelist/SalesOrderType> a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "수주유형"@ko ; skos:notation "SalesOrderType" ; skos:definition "수주 형태·성격"@ko .
